Printed with puzzle:
We are sad to report that Henry Hook, a longtime creator of Globe Magazine crossword puzzles, including today's, has died after a long illness. A brilliant puzzler, Hook had produced crosswords for this publication with co-constructors Emily Cox and Henry Rathvon since 1986. We, like his legions of fans, will miss him. —The Editors

